{"availability":"available","full":"YashBhalodi/stillpoint","name":"stillpoint","description":"A quiet ledger of the person you are becoming — local-first, installable identity habit tracker PWA","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-30T05:03:29Z","updated":"2026-07-30T06:16:59Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://stillpoint-ledger.netlify.app","topics":["habit-tracker","indexeddb","local-first","netlify","pwa","react","typescript","vite"],"demo":"https://stillpoint-ledger.netlify.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:28:49.922Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T06:28:49.922Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T06:28:49.922Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T06:28:49.922Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A quiet ledger of the person you are becoming.","Stillpoint is a local-first, installable PWA for identity-based habit tracking. Instead of counting streaks, you define the axes of the person you want to become, map your activities onto them, and check in each day — a hexagon on the Today screen shows the shape you're actually living, against the shape you designed."],"features":["Design — define identity axes (e.g. Maker, Athlete, Steward) and activities, each activity splitting its points across axes by percentage.","Today — one-tap daily check-ins; a live hexagon visualizes earned points, with the past week as a ghost outline.","Reflect — a weekly free-form journal, plus JSON backup export/import.","Local-first — no account, no server, no tracking. All data lives in your browser's IndexedDB.","Installable & offline — full PWA: precached app shell, offline navigation, automatic updates on new deploys."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/YashBhalodi/stillpoint/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7db94030f757150af2a34307d18c25c8b298c1043925c1a23d584a7fad4599c6","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T06:28:50.092Z"},"overviewCheckedAt